  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Handle Animal 3 ranks, Ride 3 ranks, Enhancement sphere, casting class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When targeting yourself with an enhancement, your mount also gains the benefits of that enhancement. This lasts as long as you are both enhanced and mounted. If you dismount or are unseated, your mount loses the benefit of your enhancement.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement#toc80\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
